module name: Event Trigger Logging
functional description:
The mdlog is automatically saved when events are triggered. 
Define required events, capture URC information from the mipc channel, and parse it. 
If there are concerned events, the mdlog when the event occurs is automatically saved for problem analysis.

1. Function opening and closing
(1) Function on
adb shell uci set system.@system[0].md_start='1'
adb shell uci set system.@system[0].md_save_mode='3'  //PLS mode
adb shell uci set system.@system[0].md_dumpback_mode='0'  //0:full dump(raw:492M,.bin:~96M) 1:mini dump(raw:162M,.bin:~14M)
adb shell uci commit
adb shell reload_config
adb shell sync
 
adb shell /etc/init.d/mdlogger reload

(2) Function off
adb shell uci set system.@system[0].md_start='0'
OR 
adb shell uci set system.@system[0].md_save_mode='1'  //USB mode

adb shell uci commit
adb shell reload_config
adb shell sync

2. Event addition
(1)Static add before compile
/quectel/package/event_trigger_logging/files/event_trigger.json
(2)Dynamic addition at run time
/etc/event_trigger.json  //Added in this json file
/etc/init.d/event_trigger_logging restart  //Restart service to take effect

3. recycle
(1) md_cyclic_size
get:
adb shell "uci show system | grep md_cyclic_size"

default 200M,any more than that will start with the oldest files.
The modem log can be up to 200M + a file size.
set:
adb shell uci set system.@system[0].md_cyclic_size='200'

(2) md_log_size
The size of the modem log file can be set as follows:
get:
adb shell "uci show system | grep md_log_size"

default 20M
set:
adb shell uci set system.@system[0].md_log_size='20'

